1
00:00:01,240 --> 00:00:16,240
Question 1: Where did Tue Tinh lead students, to do what?

2
00:00:16,910 --> 00:00:35,240
Tue Tinh led students up Nam Tao, Bac Dau mountains to explain the great value of tree leaves, grass roots of long ago.

3
00:00:38,280 --> 00:00:45,240
What did he tell students?

4
00:00:45,240 --> 00:00:54,110
A. Naming medicinal plants on the mountain.

5
00:00:54,550 --> 00:01:02,730
B. Telling about the use of each medicinal plant.

6
00:01:03,020 --> 00:01:12,130
C. Telling about the time Thai invaders invaded our country.

7
00:01:13,020 --> 00:01:18,770
Answer C

8
00:01:18,770 --> 00:01:38,840
He told students the story of long ago when Thai invaders invaded our country, kings and mandarins of Tran dynasty worried about defending the land.

9
00:01:40,130 --> 00:01:49,660
How did Thai invaders cause difficulty for us?

10
00:01:49,660 --> 00:01:59,020
A. They banned Chinese people from carrying medicine to sell to us.

11
00:01:59,020 --> 00:02:10,420
B. They caused many casualties for our army.

12
00:02:11,420 --> 00:02:19,000
C. They did not allow us to plant medicinal trees on the mountain.

13
00:02:22,440 --> 00:02:28,820
Answer A

14
00:02:29,680 --> 00:02:36,620
Question 4: How did we overcome it?

15
00:02:36,620 --> 00:02:43,510
A. Buy Chinese medicine.

16
00:02:43,510 --> 00:02:54,220
B. Send royal physicians to all regions to learn how to treat diseases with wild plants.

17
00:02:54,220 --> 00:03:05,400
C. Go up Nam Tao, Bac Dau mountains to get medicinal plants.

18
00:03:05,400 --> 00:03:10,510
Answer B

19
00:03:12,510 --> 00:03:24,220
Question 5: What was the result?

20
00:03:24,220 --> 00:03:37,130
Southern wild plants have treated wounds, protected health for our army...

21
00:03:37,860 --> 00:03:52,310
Question 6: Why did Tue Tinh tell the old story to students?

22
00:03:54,130 --> 00:04:04,310
Tue Tinh expressed the intention to follow ancestors' path together with students, using Southern medicine to treat Southern people.

